  "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">簡介：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">這個模組為你的地獄增加了多種結構與地牢，豐富你的探索體驗。地牢中設計有生怪磚與包含戰利品的寶箱，提供資源並讓你與環境互動。</p><ul>\n<li>黑曜石宮殿</li>\n<li>黑曜石小屋</li>\n<li>廣場</li>\n<li>烈焰使者塔</li>\n<li>巨型緋紅樹</li>\n<li>阿克姆</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支援的模組載入器：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我們積極支援 Forge、NeoForge 和 Fabric 模組載入器，從 1.16.5 版本到最新的 Minecraft 版本。點擊下方連結尋找適合你的模組載入器：</p><div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/fabric-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-nether-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本在這裡 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/neoforge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-nether-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge 版本在這裡 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">必要模組：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">請務必安裝以下模組，它們是專案正常運作並提供完整體驗的關鍵。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 📦 Library Ferret </a></div><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">連結：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">尋找我們的資源並加入社群：</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 連結樹 </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Github </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/197/bh_ad_see.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/189/bh_ad_cabe.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-the-end-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/190/bh_ad_end.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-edition-ocean-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/193/bh_ad_ocean.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作夥伴：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本專案由 BisectHosting 自豪贊助。查看他們的服務，輕鬆以品質與可靠性託管你的專案。</p><div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtlelisa\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"banner bisechosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a></div><h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">行動呼籲：</h2><p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有問題嗎？需要幫助嗎？加入我們的 Discord 或造訪 GitHub，與社群互動並貢獻一份心力！</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
